    <body>
      <trans-unit id="0" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>0</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_000&lt;tab&gt;So you can come and go as you please even with the isle in motion? I know not how this golden path of yours works, but it's certainly convenient.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="1" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>1</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_001&lt;tab&gt;For want of things to do, I occasionally stand watch like so...</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="2" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>2</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_002&lt;tab&gt;But there's nothing but clouds, thick and endless. I haven't caught so much as a sliver of the surface.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="3" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>3</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_100&lt;tab&gt;&lt;var 2C ((&lt;var 29 EB02 /var&gt;)) (( )) 02 /var&gt;... &lt;pant&gt; What news from beyond?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="4" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>4</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_101&lt;tab&gt;Not much...&lt;pant&gt;...to report here...</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="5" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>5</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_102&lt;tab&gt;I could do with...&lt;pant&gt;...some sparring...  </target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="6" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>6</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_103&lt;tab&gt;Mayhap Visna can craft...&lt;pant&gt;...a training dummy...</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="7" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>7</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_200&lt;tab&gt;So that's a realmship. Not quite like Azys Lla as I had imagined, but it's impressive in size.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="8" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
        <source>8</source>
        <target state="final">TEXT_REGFIM7V6E2ESTINIEN_00989_ESTINIEN_000_201&lt;tab&gt;For good or ill, the voyage has been uneventful, but I made sure to keep my skills honed. I stand ready for whatever awaits.</target>
      </trans-unit>
    </body>
